&lt;figure&gt;&lt;a data-slb-active="1" data-slb-asset="999163875" data-slb-group="8199" data-slb-internal="0" href="https://www.franzgraf.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DSC01517.jpg"&gt;&lt;img alt="" data-id="8204" decoding="async" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.franzgraf.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DSC01517-683x1024.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;figure&gt;&lt;a data-slb-active="1" data-slb-asset="2108478304" data-slb-group="8199" data-slb-internal="0" href="https://www.franzgraf.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DSC01518.jpg"&gt;&lt;img alt="" data-id="8205" decoding="async" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.franzgraf.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DSC01518-1024x683.jpg"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这条小径带我们经过一家与一座古老城堡相连的旅馆：&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 11:29:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>拉本施泰因，索菲恩洞，奈德克城堡–城堡与洞穴！（在弗兰肯瑞士的第三天）</title><link>https://www.franzgraf.de/blog/2026/rabenstein-sophienhohle-burg-neideck-castels-and-caves-day-3-in-the-frankische-schweiz/</link><description/><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 18:43:51 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>